{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1467275-wir-rich-bastard-s-guide-to-magick","id":1467275,"title":"WIR - Rich Bastard's Guide to Magick","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-09T12:02:32-08:00","id":1467275,"title":"WIR - Rich Bastard's Guide to Magick","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">hello all! I thought i'd make a WIR. Please be mindful that i'm not fluent and english,so may commit some typos. Also,this book discusses a little bit of politics,and I will comment on it with my own takes,feel free to disagree with me,just be polite <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.finally,i'm finishing a semester on online college,so this will be slow,sorry.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">with that outta the way,on to the book</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Fiction - According to Plan</i></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">this one is not very philosophical or full of social commentary like a lot of mage fiction,i love it anyway. It's two young mages stealing something very valuable to much richer and influential mages,it's simple and to the point, and very cheeky.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Introduction - What is the Rich Bastard's Guide to Magick?</i></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">This books is in many ways, a high powered character book done in a unconventional way, the power the characters have is not necessarily magical,but it is economic,social and political. Make no mistake,this is not a celebration of capitalism or greed as a whole,but it doesn't entirely condemn those two things the book's presentation of the ultra rich,while ver negative in places does allow for the possibility of having a lot of money and still be a good. I appreciate it, personally I haven't decided where my political,social and economical ideologies are,but in broad strokes,i'm not a fan of capitalism at all it's an system that hurts people everyday,but I have my doubts if communism is the answer</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">but,back to the book...</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Chapter One,Money and the Mage</i></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">this one answers a question many have,why would a mage care about money at all? doesn't magic supply all of their needs? And the answer is a little complex,but i think i get it. It takes time to learn the spheres,time and effort. Money usually takes less,nothing to mention making what you need appear out of thin air is super vulgar and will eventually hit you with paradox,not to mention draw attention from enemies you surely have. Money is part of the current system,using it draw less attention</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">the next section explains how wealth and money helps in tons of ways, after all,mages need their foci and they may expensive! And more importantly,some Paradigms involve social pressure and manipulation,and what better way there is to do that than to showcase money? It explicitly say a place in the Rich List let you have a big metaphorical badge saying &quot; I AM POWERFUL&quot; for better and for the worst.</span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-09T12:03:06-08:00","id":1467276,"title":"","content":"next section coming soon-ish,remind me if i forget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-19T22:36:46-08:00","id":1468384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1467275-wir-rich-bastard-s-guide-to-magick?p=1467276#post1467276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">next section coming soon-ish,remind me if i forget.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are being reminded. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T01:53:29-08:00","id":1468389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1467275-wir-rich-bastard-s-guide-to-magick?p=1468384#post1468384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You are being reminded. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Gonna need a one day more,sorry for the hassle","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T13:37:33-08:00","id":1468422,"title":"","content":"<i><u>The Traditions and the Invisible Hand</u></i><br /> <br /> Basically,this sections tells us what each tradition thinks about money as a object,a concept and a means to an end<br /> The Akashayana draw a lor of their style of magic from Buddhism, thus most of them took poverty vowls,but some do believe money can be used for good.<br /> The Celestial Chorus lean heavily on the Bible saying it the root of all evil,they almost away think money is not a good way to serve The One,unless they're from the prosperity gospel...<br /> The Sahajiya don't really care if you're wealth,it's immaterial to them,unless getting money makes you feel ecstatic<br /> The Dreamspeakers believe their colonial enemies did what they did mostly for money so they mostly don't like it,however,they're also petty pragmatic. So they accept using the enemy weapon against them...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T13:42:01-08:00","id":1468423,"title":"","content":"The Chakravanti see it as a distraction,part of the wheel of Samsara and they want off.<br /> The Order of Hermes are all about Power,and money can be a means to gain itt.<br /> The Society of Ether are practical about it, sciende is expensive, so they distribute costs.<br /> The Verbena this money is bs,it'd made up,doesn't make sense. But they do get it some times for practical purposes.<br /> And finally,my favorite section. Thr Virtual Adepts who want nothing more than taking the<br /> economy always from those darn techies...<br /> <br /> All in all this section is nearly perfect,the Traditions are on point!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 11-20-2021, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T13:53:14-08:00","id":1468424,"title":"","content":"You missed the Verbena.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-20T14:10:58-08:00","id":1468426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1467275-wir-rich-bastard-s-guide-to-magick?p=1468424#post1468424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You missed the Verbena.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That's what I get for trying do lote of things at the same time","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-27T18:47:51-08:00","id":1469057,"title":"","content":"Things got a sharper turn than expected,it will take make me a while to get this one going but I will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T10:18:10-08:00","id":1470047,"title":"","content":"The Crafts also have a complicated relationship with money and wealth in general<br /> <br /> The Batini beleive in a mystical Union,and they see all material goods distracting them from it. Hower, no one likes to decapitate a Nephandi like a Subtle One,and Nephandi loove the halls of power. Thus it is a point of pride that a Batini can survive among the ultra rich and not fall to temptation.<br /> <br /> The Bata'a are a Craft who fights a lot with the tukra rich,because many ultra rich are racist,however they don't really see money as a bad thing,for the Loa/Orisha need offering,whoich aren't always cheap.<br /> <br /> The Children of Knowledge were built by alchemists,a nd there's nothing a alchemist likes more than turning lead into gold. besides,they're rivals of the syndicate. Which means they build underground economies to fight back against them<br /> <br /> The Hollow ones are also made by many people who were oppressed by rich people,but they're big on screewing up the master's house ith the master's tools. Meaning they do their best to use wealth to destroy wealthy enemies<br /> <br /> The Kopa Loei like to use prime to do ventures similar to the ones capitalist do,chances are the syndicate copied them<br /> <br /> Orphans are eccletic as they come,but some of them do use money whatever goals they might have<br /> <br /> Hyppolotoi are hardcore feminists,and lemme tell ya,wealthy feminists do more harm than good most of the time. but they do believe in democracy,and help each other when they need it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T10:24:01-08:00","id":1470048,"title":"","content":"Ngoma are their heirs of african empires,and they want cahs both for personal growth and for the good of the nations that suceeded those empires<br /> <br /> Wu Lung love gold,and some of them don't think use gold as currency is a good idea,however they have a rivalry with the technocracy,both trying to control chinese economic growth<br /> <br /> Templars,unlike the chorus. IUse money to bludgeon enemies of the church<br /> <br /> The Taftani have their stronghold in Dubai,need i say more? They make wonders,with wealth and bhelp civilization grow with it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T16:51:51-08:00","id":1470086,"title":"","content":"I wonder which Mage group the character played by Rihanna in &quot;Bitch Better Have My Money&quot; would belong to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}